impose restrictions on the topic of discussion.  This is the same argument
they make about student papers.  Once they let one teacher's group access
their classrooms, they have to let any teacher's group access those same
classrooms.  They can still exclude bricklayers, pet shop owners, etc.
Once they let in one bricklayers' group, they all have the same right of
access.


