some speakers is evidence that the Government did not intend to create such
a forum, no speaker challenging denial of access will ever be able to prove
that the forum is a limited public forum.  The very fact that the Government
denied access to the speaker indicates that the Government did not intend to
provide an open forum for expressive activity, and (that) fact alone would
demonstrate that the forum is not a limited public forum."

