and you'll be dealt with.

To write a cancelbot that dealt with ordinary users would get you dealt
with and fast.  That one can write one for C&S and get only praise
indicates that this time it wasn't a problem.  The system is supposed to
have rough edges, unlike systems of law, which are meant to be knowable.
